            <h1 class="hero-title">I help organisations become talent destinations.</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">With over a decade of experience in marketing, specialising in recruitment marketing and employer branding, I partner with organisations to attract, engage, and retain the right talent through strategic, data-driven approaches.</p>
