                    <p>I am a seasoned marketing and brand expert with deep experience developing and executing multi-market talent attraction programmes across the globe.</p>
                    <p>My work spans the full spectrum of talent attraction, from conducting comprehensive recruitment marketing audits to developing and executing employer brand strategies that deliver measurable results. I translate complex employer brand strategies into compelling candidate experiences that attract diverse, high-calibre talent.</p>
                    <p>I am based in Dublin, Ireland, and work with organisations locally and across Europe and beyond.</p>
