                <div class="about-highlights">
                    <h3>Core Expertise</h3>
                    <ul class="expertise-list">
                        <li>Recruitment Marketing Strategy & Execution</li>
                        <li>Employer Brand Development</li>
                        <li>Employer Value Proposition (EVP) Development & Localisation</li>
                        <li>Data-Driven Talent Intelligence</li>
                        <li>Candidate Experience Design</li>
                        <li>Multi-Market Campaign Execution</li>
