                        <li>Mini MBA in Brand Management, Marketing Week</li>
                        <li>Mini MBA in Marketing, Marketing Week</li>
                        <li>Digital Psychology & Persuasion, CXL</li>
                        <li>BSc Computer Science, Budapest University of Technology</li>
                    </ul>
                    <h3>Recognition</h3>
                    <ul class="education-list">
                        <li>Business & Finance CMO 100 Index (2023, 2024, 2025)</li>
                        <li>Winner, Best in Recruitment, Spider Awards</li>
